.SH "نام (NAME)"
iasecc-tool \- displays information about IAS/ECC card
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBiasecc\-tool\fR\ 'u
\fBiasecc\-tool\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The
\fBiasecc\-tool\fR
utility is used to display information about IAS/ECC v1\&.0\&.1 smart cards\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
.PP
\fB\-\-reader\fR \fIarg\fR,
.RS 4
Number of the reader to use\&. By default, the first reader with a present card is used\&. If
\fIarg\fR
is an ATR, the reader with a matching card will be chosen\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-list\-applications\fR,
.RS 4
Get list of the on\-card applications\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-aid\fR \fIhex\-aid\fR,
.RS 4
Select
\fIhex\-aid\fR
before processing\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-list\-sdos\fR \fIsdo\-type\fR,
.RS 4
List SDOs of the given
\fIsdo\-type\fR, present in default or selected application\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR, \fB\-v\fR
.RS 4
Causes
\fBcardos\-tool\fR
to be more verbose\&. Specify this flag several times to enable debug output in the opensc library\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-wait\fR, \fB\-w\fR
.RS 4
Causes
\fBiasecc\-tool\fR
to wait for the token to be inserted into reader\&.
.RE
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
\fBiasecc\-tool\fR
was written by Viktor Tarasov
<viktor\&.tarasov@gmail\&.com>\&.
